UID:k9k6vDBogJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nPresented by Sea Slug Animation 
 Festival Kick off the festival with RITA\, an ode to a beloved snail of a 
 grandmother\, and the Seattle premiere of ENDLESS COOKIE\, a vibey and psy
 chedelic memoir/conversation/brotherly hangout from Canadian filmmakers Se
 th and Peter Scriver.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/sea-slug-
 animation/opening-night-rita-and-endless-cookie\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
