BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Retrospective Spotlight: Dédé (Ancestor) & Son of the White Mare
DTSTART:20260301T030000Z
DTEND:20260301T045000Z
DTSTAMP:20260301T030000Z
UID:nGhvaFfNiq
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nPresented by Sea Slug Animation F
 estival  Delve into the Ivory Coast’s feminine cosmology through DÉDÉ
  (ANCESTOR) before flying off into the psychedelic folklore of SON OF THE 
 WHITE MARE—one of the greatest animated films of all time\, now restored
  in 4K from the original 35mm camera negative and sound elements.\n\nhttps
 ://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/sea-slug-animation/retrospective-spotli
 ght-dede-(ancestor)-and-son-of-the-white-mare\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
